        <head>CONFIRMATION FROM WARRINGTON.</head>
        <p>CONFIRMATION FROM WARRINGTON.</p>
        <p>It is possiLle to mobs " bent" into "better." When first given this testimony from Warrington tons of the bent ; but now it is better became it is cohnemed by the test of dorability. The following two statements are made by Mrs. M. Allutt, 32, Rostock-street, Bank Quay, Warrington, regarding the cure of her kidney trouble by Doan's pills. TllO second statement was Inside over eighteen months after the first and pro.. that the good Mrs. Mrs. Allott receist d from Doan's pills was lasting. First statement :—"leer some years I shffered greatly with my 'shiner," she mid, " I need to get dreadful pains in theanaill of my ...Arend between my shoulders; when I did any bending I found its hard matter to get op agein, and while I was doing my washing I often bad to leave off and rents bit. I wss treated by a doctor for kidney complaint, lent I didn't improto at all. "1 was very bad at the time I heard of Doan', pills end Iliad to keep to my bed, kik ith the use of these pills I wee soon able to get up, and gradually my health returned. I can now go about my work with ease, and I feel much better in all wiry,. I shall not fail to recommend Dodn's pills. (Signed) 31, Allot t." Second statement, Inside eighteen mouths later : "hints using Doan's pills, I have kept very well," said Mrs. Allott to a representative. " I hare great faith in the remedy and always recommend it. I always keep some of the pills in the hearse." The genuine DORIA Pahl give the sick kidneyti just the help needed—they di lee out of the body all the liquid poisons th It Calleo dropsy, uriosry disorders, gravel, rheurnati.m, stone, sciatica, nervous ills, sleep- lessnese and depression. Diner's her knolls kidney pills are two shillings and ninepeoce per not (six boxes for thirteen shillings and nine.) Of all chemists end stoves or post free, direct from Foster NfeClellso Co , ii, Wells rarest, Oxford-street, London, W. Do not forget to use the name DOAN'S.</p>
