      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-04-08_WidnesExaminer_art0040" n="art0040">
        <p>LOCAL PARS.</p>
        <p>Person!.</p>
        <p>We regret to Iv ar that Mr. Harry Berrey, the popular couductor t the Apollo Mole Voice Choir and the St ckton Heath Choral Society, Us lying seriously ill at hie residence in Fairfield-road, thocktcn Heath. . . . _</p>
        <p>Mr. C. E. Parker who In, been suffering from a sharp attack of Gastritis is now making steady pro- gram towards recovery. and hope, soon to be able to resume Lie various duties.</p>
