        <p>BABY S FACE LOOKED LIKE PIECE OF RAW BEEF. '• Ify baby boy, twelve months ago, had r pimple come on his forehead. It I unit and apt over his flee which soon looktd like a piece beef, all smothered with had pimple.. It was to look at. The poor little thing used to ccr and cry Lei ribly. I took him to a doctor, hut 11, got worm until I wee qui.e hightened that lie :dusys be disfigured. Then I sent for some Ct Ointment and after using it I found that ba longer scratched h;s face. So I got in all two tins of Cutiettra Ointment, together with Cr Soap, and in two months the Cuticara Itemedi quite cured hint. Now I always keep a Calicoes Ointment by me in caw of anythir coming, and of course I use Colima' Soap for children.</p>
