        <p>"I had been in bed for -months when, fortunately, my moth, r read in the newspapers of a core of Unseen's After-Effects by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. " I took three or four boxes of Dr. Williams' Pink Pills and my health logan to mend. My nerves became steadier and I wns able to assimilate solid fo d. I continued with the Pills and in time I could take a little exercise ; then appetite became ,Juite ken. In time the swellings disappeared from my limbs ; my heart became steady end I was no longer troubled with the sinking meatier el. 'As I persevered with Dr. Williams' Pink Pills all pain left me and my strength returned. I regained my lost flesh, ami it was not long before I was at work again. The new, good blood supplied by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills drove all traces of set &amp;knees and disease root my system, and it is my firm conviction, shared by toy nurse, that Dr. Williams' Pink Pills saved my life."</p>
